1
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,240
Zhi'an, run!

2
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:45,360
Release Zhu Huaijin

3
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,880
and I'll give you the Dragon Jade

4
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,760
You've kept this from me for so long

5
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:50,400
and still expect me to let him go?

6
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,520
In your dreams

7
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,320
No!

8
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,560
Since I'm here

9
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:58,680
I intend to give you the map

10
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:00,280
The map is on me

11
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,400
Don't!

12
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:11,240
Never thought right under my nose

13
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:13,880
such a devoted couple could emerge

14
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:16,520
Dying won't be that easy

15
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:19,760
The Dragon Jade treasure is on you

16
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:22,160
How about this

17
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:26,120
For every five steps Zhu Huaijin takes forward

18
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:27,960
you remove one piece of clothing

19
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:29,880
What do you say?

20
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:31,840
No! Absolutely not, Zhi'an!

21
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,760
Shut up

22
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:36,800
Not allowed

23
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,240
She loves you so much

24
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,600
You should just accept it

25
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,160
Fine

26
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:49,000
I promise you

27
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,160
Let's go

28
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:55,320
I won't go, I won't go

29
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:21,240
Don't, Zhi An

30
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:49,920
Take it off

31
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,200
You shouldn't have come

32
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:23,960
Even if it costs me my life, I'll get you out of here

33
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,320
I don't want you to die

34
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,080
I want you to live

35
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,240
Last piece

36
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,080
Take it off

37
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:11,400
Seventh Prince

38
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,200
You dare trick me

39
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:16,680
Kill

40
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:28,080
Kill! Kill!

41
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:53,640
Ruined my back

42
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,400
Thus the Dragon Jade Map shall never resurface

43
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:05,880
I underestimated you

44
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:07,720
All this began because of the Dragon Jade Map

45
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,960
I won't let those I love and who love me

46
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:10,920
Fall into danger again

47
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,320
Nor will I abandon Huaijin ever again

48
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:18,560
Do it

49
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,240
Does it hurt?

50
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:06,200
It's nothing compared to what you've sacrificed for me

51
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:11,280
You knew all along the Dragon Jade was behind you

52
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:12,560
You...

53
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,720
It seems Heaven

54
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:20,160
Has granted us both a chance to live again

55
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:25,040
So that's how it is

56
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:27,520
No wonder

57
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:30,400
I've been so cautious

58
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,800
Fearing you might get hurt again

59
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,480
But

60
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,880
You knew the truth all along

61
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:45,720
So it was you who stayed with me till my dying breath

62
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:46,840
Wasn't it?

63
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,720
Zhi An

64
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:08,200
Zhi An

65
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:09,920
Zhi An

66
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,440
Huai Chen, Zhi An

67
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:18,080
Is that you?

68
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:28,400
The one Zhi An married isn't Zhu Huai Chen, it's me

69
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:34,440
Zhi An

70
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:35,800
Zhi An

71
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,360
Zhi An

72
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,280
In the next life

73
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:35,640
May all this suffering

74
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:38,760
Fall upon me alone

75
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,600
It was Duan Yurou who killed you

76
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:16,440
Yet in this lifetime, I still failed to protect you

77
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,200
In our previous life

78
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:22,000
I was the one who killed him

79
00:09:22,680 --> 00:09:24,320
You were reborn in your youth

80
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,200
You could have avoided all this

81
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:28,640
But got dragged into this vortex because of me

82
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,360
Even suffered torment

83
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:32,160
And became addicted to Five Minerals Powder

84
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:34,080
If I hadn't been constantly suspicious

85
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,160
and trusted you sooner

86
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:38,160
you could have suffered so much less

87
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,640
Don't talk about yourself like that

88
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:47,280
I just arrogantly thought I was protecting you completely

89
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,720
But I never considered

90
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:53,360
how terrified you must have been

91
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,480
when you saw me impersonating Zhu Huaichen

92
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,400
You were right not to trust me

93
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:58,680
Besides,

94
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:03,000
my worthless life didn't deserve your rescue

95
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,360
What do you mean 'worthless'?

96
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:08,240
You can't treat your own life so carelessly

97
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,000
All of us risked everything to save you

98
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,480
and you say it wasn't worth it?

99
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,440
Heaven gave you a second chance at life

100
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,720
and you're treating it with such contempt

101
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,880
I... my whole existence was for you

102
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,400
You should live for yourself

103
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:20,280
If you don't even value your own life

104
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:21,320
how can you talk about protecting me?

105
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:23,360
How could you just die like this without a care

106
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:25,800
Do you expect me to suffer alone for the rest of my life

107
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:27,760
Is this how you show your love for me

108
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:30,760
Zhi An

109
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,480
You... you to me

110
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,120
I didn't

111
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:36,360
You did

112
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,920
You said if I were to die

113
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:40,120
You would suffer for the rest of your life

114
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:41,920
You like me

115
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:43,400
You have feelings for me, don't you

116
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,080
You're right

117
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:48,040
My life isn't worthless

118
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,840
As long as you care about me

119
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:53,040
I'll live well

120
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:02,160
Even without me

121
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:03,880
You must keep living well

122
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:06,040
Just like how I would live well

123
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:08,200
Even without you

124
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:12,240
The most important thing in life is oneself

125
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:16,600
Since heaven has given us a second chance at life

126
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:20,240
We shouldn't dwell on past wounds and hatred

127
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:22,320
Once this matter is settled

128
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:24,160
I'd rather see

129
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:26,000
What you and I would be like

130
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:27,560
If we laid down our swords

131
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,800
This world is corrupt

132
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,880
Many choose to sink into depravity

133
00:11:35,880 --> 00:11:37,360
Becoming accomplices to this era

134
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:39,920
Then someone must rise to overthrow it all

135
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,080
And remake the world anew

136
00:11:41,520 --> 00:11:42,800
If the world were just

137
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:45,080
You, me, Duan Yurou

138
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:46,800
Even Zhu Huaichen

139
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:48,360
Might all have been different

140
00:11:48,920 --> 00:11:51,200
Perhaps we'd have met amidst blooming flowers

141
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:53,480
Or crossed paths by mountains and lakes

142
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,120
The you back then

143
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:57,000
Would surely have had a different state of mind

144
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,400
And better understood your own worth

145
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:04,920
Then let me be the one to overturn everything

146
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:07,280
Zhi'an

147
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:10,400
Will you join me?

148
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:12,640
I will

149
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:23,640
There's still time to turn back

150
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:26,960
I still have a chance to turn back

151
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:44,520
Duan Yurou has left

152
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,320
Perhaps it's for the best

153
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,320
News came from the princess

154
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,680
The Li family's old allies are heading to the capital

155
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:54,760
They've finally come
